-- WebSocket upgrade through Flask (the WSGI limitation) --
Attempting an Upgrade: websocket handshake to ws://127.0.0.1:8588/ ...
HTTP/1.1 400 BAD REQUEST
(WSGI cannot complete a WS upgrade in-process: Werkzeug's dev server
 rejects the Upgrade request outright; even a production WSGI server
 has no PEP-3333 hook to hijack the socket. The realtime transport
 therefore does NOT work through Flask — use the FastAPI/ASGI example
 or an ASGI server / ingress in front for the WS path.)

